  "text": "At first just head tingling in my right side.\nJaw clenching made worse.\nIBS better but terrible smelling gas at times and Belching.\nFirst two weeks nausea not hungry.\nSweet cravings.\nI have lost 8 pounds in 4 weeks.\nI take it in the morning 60mg and have energy all day.\nRestless leg type jitters.\nNo outburst on hudband or kids anymore.\nFeel Well and calm but take ativan in the late afternoon to relax.\nOh I also crave beer sometimes is weird.\nOh ya really sucky thing is hard to have orgasms.\nI am going to try to stick with the drug at least for 6 months it really seems to help.\nHopfully then I can go off and keep the ativan for daily use.\n",
